{
"body": "The fix for the issue affecting Offsite campaign reporting in markets using currencies other than EUR has been successfully deployed to production today.\nFrom now on, newly calculated values for Sales and ROAS will display correctly for all CMax Offsite clients.\n\nPlease note that this was a UI display issue only \u2014 campaign performance, data collection, and delivery were not affected at any point.\n\nThank you for your patience and understanding while we worked to resolve this issue.",
"first_seen": "2026-09-04T07:06:16Z",
"impact": "minor",
"last_seen": "2026-09-04T17:10:49Z",
